  "description": {

    "en": "Luxilon 4G is one of the benchmark control polyester strings in professional tennis. Designed with strategically aligned molecular chains and Poly-Ether-Ether materials, it minimizes tension loss while maintaining exceptional consistency throughout its lifespan. The string delivers outstanding control, stability and durability with a slightly cushioned impact feel. The 1.25 mm version offers additional feel and response, while the 1.30 mm version prioritizes durability and long-term stability. Used by Serena Williams, Venus Williams and Grigor Dimitrov, 4G has become one of the industry's standards for tension maintenance.",

    "zh": "Luxilon 4G 是职业网坛最具代表性的控制型聚酯球线之一。采用特殊排列的高分子链结构（Strategically Aligned Molecular Chains）以及 Poly-Ether-Ether 材料，大幅降低张力衰减，在整个使用寿命内保持极高的一致性。4G 提供优秀的控制、稳定性与耐久性，同时拥有比传统聚酯更柔和的击球反馈。1.25mm 更强调手感与反馈；1.30mm 更强调耐久性、稳定性及长期保磅能力。目前 Serena Williams、Venus Williams 与 Grigor Dimitrov 等职业球员均曾使用 4G 系列。"
  },

